== Usage ==
Displays the crowdsourced drop table for the current NPC page:
<pre>
{{MobDrops}}
</pre>
Or explicitly specify the NPC name:
<pre>
{{MobDrops|Giant Spider}}
{{MobDrops|Skeleton Warrior (Lvl 28)}}
</pre>
[[Category:Drop templates]]
</noinclude>
